/-!
# True values of the high-resolution family pipeline of the guiding-centre torus

The value `XHM c i` of each variable of the high-resolution family ball pipeline at the parameter
`w = c`: for the variables shared with the low-resolution pipeline, the low-resolution values
`XLM c u z (lmapHM i)` at the family torus `(u, z) = (xHM c 4, xHM c 5)`; for the others, the
transport inputs `2^96 𝓛u`, the derivatives, the embedded low-resolution torus and the node data.
The identity of every node (`relHM_*`) is the identity of the low-resolution node with renamed
variables (`rel_rename`). Generated by `scripts/gc_kam/lam_emit_lean.py`.

Pitch cell `λ ∈ [1/16, 1/8]`: modules `RationalStellaratorGCMu2*`,
namespace `PlasmaLean.Design.RationalStellaratorGC.Mu2`; generated by
`scripts/gc_kam/lamcell` from the pipeline of the cell `[0, 1/16]`.
-/

@[expose] public section
noncomputable section

